<%- include('../partials/head', { pageTitle: pageTitle }) %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<main class="fb-container fb-main">
  <div class="fb-content">
    <h1 class="fb-title fb-title--small">Log In or Sign Up</h1>

    <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="fb-notice">
        <p><strong>That did not work.</strong></p>
        <p><%= error %></p>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <form class="fb-auth" method="post" action="/login">
      <div class="fb-auth__row">
        <label for="login-username">Character Name</label>
        <input id="login-username" name="username" type="text" autocomplete="username"
               value="<%= values ? values.username : '' %>" maxlength="20" required autofocus>
      </div>
      <div class="fb-auth__row">
        <label for="login-password">Password</label>
        <input id="login-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password"
               minlength="8" required>
      </div>
      <div class="fb-auth__actions">
        <button class="fb-btn fb-btn--primary" type="submit">Log In</button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <div class="fb-prose" style="margin-top:16px">
      <p>Pick a name and a password. If the name has not been taken it becomes your account and you are signed in. If it is already yours, the password signs you back in. There is no separate sign-up step.</p>

      <p>A name is 3 to 20 characters: letters, numbers and underscores. A password needs at least 8 characters.</p>

      <h2>Names that are not available</h2>
      <p>Slurs, sexual terms and the names of people who committed atrocities are refused, as are names that would look like FieldBrik staff. The name is checked on the server, so it is refused however it is sent.</p>

      <h2>Forgotten your password?</h2>
      <p>Password recovery is not built yet. If an account is locked out, the support page says how to ask for help.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
